    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, click Zulip's settings button on the top right, then \"Organizational settings\", then \"Linkifiers\" (or click this <a href=\"#organization/linkifier-settings\">direct link</a>).<br>\nThis one specifically uses the default <code>foo#123</code> one that links to <code>.../leanprover-community/foo/pull/123</code>, which is the penultimate item on the list right now. The last item gives <code>foo/bar#123</code> for any GitHub repo which is nice.</p>",
        "id": 593939691,
